  "platform": "macOS arm64, system Apple clang21.0.0 C++20 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic -Werror; existing bundled NumPy only for dense reference linear algebra and actual-field comparisons; no dependencies installed.",
  "method": {
    "matrix": "Read native .entries/.rhs and cell areas. Sum duplicate triplets in native order, preserve complete K and b for every Krylov product and true-residual evaluation. No independent PDE implementation.",
    "preconditioner": "Right upper triangular block inverse: pressure z_p=-M_g^{-1}r_p (nu=1 source); velocity z_u=IC0(A)^{-1}(r_u-K_up*z_p). IC0 is existing product SparseSystem2D, no shift, pivot replacement or silent fallback.",
    "pressure_mass": "The eliminated gauge is p_last=0. For retained means M_g=diag(V_i)-V_i*V_j/V_total. Exact inverse is diag(1/V_i)+1*1^T/V_last. A separate plain-diagonal control deliberately omits the rank-one term.",
    "velocity_matrix": "Only the preconditioner averages opposite A entries. K itself is unchanged. Union sparsity retains one-sided roundoff entries; missing opposite coefficient is zero. Recorded symmetry-correction key in raw logs reports the original pair difference; each coefficient changes by half that value.",
    "krylov": "Existing newtonKrylovDirection2D, at most60 directions per restart, two orthogonalisation passes, internal0.1 reduction target; outer at most50 restarts checks the actual unpreconditioned residual. No normal equations.",
    "linear_control": "Raw algebraic norm ||b-Kx||2/||b||2 in the source SI/reference-unit convention. rtol=1e-11 reuses the existing linear relative-control value without its mixed-unit absolute floor. This is not a units-invariant CFD residual or pressure/continuity acceptance gate.",
    "tight_control": "One sheared16 case uses1e-13 in the same algebraic norm to check that actual field errors and native continuity improve; adds32 Krylov products. Not a production-default change.",
    "failure": "IC0 invalid pivots and input format failures explicitly exit. Budget/nonconvergence writes .candidate, exits2 and never .solution. Existing output prefixes are not overwritten.",
    "support": "Current source format: nu=1, zero pressure block, last-cell constant pressure gauge, four velocity modes per internal face, all physical boundary velocities prescribed. Not yet the future traction-outlet or Navier-Stokes system."
  },
  "units": {
    "velocity_field_difference": "m/s; full P1 cell polynomial area RMS, plus shared-face endpoint maximum",
    "pressure_difference": "m^2/s^2; full P1 pressure polynomial area RMS after one global mean shift",
    "divergence": "s^-1; native recovery integral-point sample maximum",
    "energy_balance": "m^4/s^3 per unit density/depth",
    "residual": "dimensionless numerical relative norm in the fixed coefficient convention; componentwise physical residuals remain separate"
  },
